{"name": "Revelation of Decay", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf\u00a0<strong>Open World in a Post-Apocalyptic World</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Traverse zombie-infested lost towns, cross perilous snowy plains, and infiltrate mysterious military bases\u2026 Eight distinctly styled regions await (and maybe more). Each area presents unique hazards and mechanics. Scavenge vital resources to stay alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"160\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975680/extras/3a995543ab8d3e46966825dc04253dd5.poster.avif?t=1778578055\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975680/extras/3a995543ab8d3e46966825dc04253dd5.webm?t=1778578055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975680/extras/3a995543ab8d3e46966825dc04253dd5.mp4?t=1778578055\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf\u00a0<strong>Awaken Your Powers to Battle the Bizarreness</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 200 items and 50+ special supernatural abilities. Customize your weapons to the max to build the ultimate end-times loadout. Face off against powerful bosses with unique mechanics. Fight the bizarre world with bizarre powers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"160\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975680/extras/6b44eb1b34ea1a952852ed60473d7adb.poster.avif?t=1778578055\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975680/extras/6b44eb1b34ea1a952852ed60473d7adb.webm?t=1778578055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975680/extras/6b44eb1b34ea1a952852ed60473d7adb.mp4?t=1778578055\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf\u00a0<strong>Form Your Legion for an Unbeatable Force</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rally every survivor you can find, be they NPCs, former foes, or even the good boys of the \u201cWoof Pack\u201d! Lead up to 30 companions into battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>P.S. Co-op supported, double your companions with a friend, and never fear the zombie hordes again.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"160\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975680/extras/984f97acf0b5ab0ca1c3fb8cee70104d.poster.avif?t=1778578055\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975680/extras/984f97acf0b5ab0ca1c3fb8cee70104d.webm?t=1778578055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975680/extras/984f97acf0b5ab0ca1c3fb8cee70104d.mp4?t=1778578055\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf\u00a0<strong>Zombie-Powered Factory</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Few people remain in the apocalypse, but zombies are in abundant supply. Exploit their labor to create your base of operations. Leap from hands-on farming straight into electrified automation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"160\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975680/extras/276d9e1614e36dc068ba3b59543a4c08.poster.avif?t=1778578055\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975680/extras/276d9e1614e36dc068ba3b59543a4c08.webm?t=1778578055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975680/extras/276d9e1614e36dc068ba3b59543a4c08.mp4?t=1778578055\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf\u00a0<strong>Dusk-Time Party Painted by Rust-Tinged Pixels</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pixels of rusty reds and warm oranges blend to bring this post-apocalyptic world to life. Let the fantasy-filled dusk party begin!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"256\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975680/extras/de9dbd4719f0b289b18863aa4386d744.poster.avif?t=1778578055\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975680/extras/de9dbd4719f0b289b18863aa4386d744.webm?t=1778578055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975680/extras/de9dbd4719f0b289b18863aa4386d744.mp4?t=1778578055\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Revelation of Decay is a zombie survival game that\u2019s less \u201cscary\u201d and even a bit lively. Explore this pixelated world full of bizarre anomalies, awaken supernatural powers, and, amid endless zombie hordes and mutated monsters, gradually uncover the truth behind the invasion.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975680/23884f1dba8751de17dd2c84aef1e042c7e0a076/header.jpg?t=1778578055", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Survival", "Zombies", "Open World", "Action", "Top-Down Shooter", "2D"], "developers": "\u72fc\u732b\u6e38\u620f / Wolfy Cat", "publishers": "\u72fc\u732b\u6e38\u620f / Wolfy Cat", "release_date": "2026", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "2975680", "review_type": "Not Recommended", "curator_desc": "30 May 2024 - Request Access\n\n4 June 2025 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/o_iapNSVNaA", "first_seen": 1717020000.0, "review_rank": 1612}